+"@x402/stellar": minor
+---
+
+The Stellar exact facilitator accepts an optional `allowedAuthEventContracts` list. Simulation events emitted by those contracts are skipped by the transfer event check, so a smart-account payer whose policies emit their own events in `__check_auth` can be verified. The list is empty by default and verification is unchanged without it. Events from the payment asset are always checked, and exactly one matching `transfer` is still required.
